flowchart TB
    A["Jalur A: Undangan Mandiri (Terencana)\n1. Operator terbitkan VPINV_ (160-bit)\n2. Tamu isi biodata & K3/NDA + IP\n3. Compliance Vetting -> approve()"]
    B["Jalur B: Penerbitan Darurat (Walk-In)\n1. Petugas pos jaga input identitas\n2. Cek kontrak CRM & rak pelanggan\n3. Status langsung scheduled"]

    C1["VisitorPassService (Laravel 12)\nVPQR_ (160-bit) -> SHA-256 token_hash\nAES-256 encrypted_token + 256-bit URL\nSurel dikirim via DB::afterCommit()"]
    C2[("Basis Data Relasional\ndc_visitor_pass (9 status)\ndc_visitor_access_log (8 kode)")]
    C3["Scheduler 10 Menit\ndc-ops:check-visitor-pass-status\nDeteksi expired & overstayed"]

    D["E-Badge Publik (No-Auth, Fail-Closed)\nGET /v1/public/visitor-pass/{token}\nWhitelist 8 field, sensor PII, no-store\nLocal QR: Server SVG & Browser PNG"]
    E["Scanner Pos Jaga (React 18)\nWebcam jsQR, Foto BarcodeDetector, USB HID\nPOST /scan-verify (lockForUpdate 6 Lapis)\nLive Headcount & Check-Out Idempotent"]

    A -->|"POST /{id}/approve"| C1
    B -->|"POST /visitor-passes"| C1
    C1 --> C2
    C3 <--> C2
    C2 -->|"Dekripsi Fail-Closed"| D
    D -.->|"Pindai QR"| E
    E <-->|"Row Lock + Audit"| C2

